From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:16:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Add the S_IR_RX controller

Add the CIR receiver of the CPUS domain at 0x07040000 (A733 manual,
memory map and 18.16), interrupt SPI 206 (12.2.3.1), with its bus gate,
reset and module clock in the PRCM (4.2.5.20, 4.2.5.21), disabled.
Add the pin group for PL6, function 5 (18.14.7.1), which the Radxa
Cubie A7S routes to pin 13 of its header J11; the board carries no
IR receiver.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: with the node enabled on PL6 in a copy of the
DTB, every level change of the open pin, made with its pull resistor,
raises the interrupt and gives raw samples.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index b0473c959c7f..0c0e96a99043 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -1695,6 +1695,24 @@ r_i2c1_pl12_pins: r-i2c1-pl12-pins {
 				allwinner,pinmux = <3>;
 				function = "r_i2c1";
 			};
+
+			/omit-if-no-ref/
+			r_ir_rx_pl6_pin: r-ir-rx-pl6-pin {
+				pins = "PL6";
+				allwinner,pinmux = <5>;
+				function = "s_cir_rx";
+			};
+		};
+
+		r_ir: ir@7040000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-ir",
+				     "allwinner,sun6i-a31-ir";
+			reg = <0x07040000 0x400>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 206 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&r_ccu CLK_BUS_R_IR_RX>, <&r_ccu CLK_R_IR_RX>;
+			clock-names = "apb", "ir";
+			resets = <&r_ccu RST_BUS_R_IR_RX>;
+			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
 		pck600: power-controller@7060000 {
